the time of payment and to the addition or release of any other party primarily or secondarily liable hereunder. </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-indent:9%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">(f) <I>Notices.</I> All
